astrbot_plugin_ascii
====================

This repository contains only the AstrBot plugin. It does NOT bundle any
source code, font, or demo asset from ASCII-generator. At runtime the plugin
launches the separately installed upstream scripts as a local subprocess.
See docs/SETUP.md for how to install and connect the upstream project.


