A small compatibility patch for Pillow >= 10 (ImageFont.getsize -> getbbox)
is provided in patches/pillow12-getsize.patch. It is meant to be applied to
your own copy of the upstream repository and is offered under the same MIT
terms as this plugin.


2. Font
-------

The upstream scripts load fonts/DejaVuSansMono-Bold.ttf by relative path.
That font belongs to the DejaVu Fonts project (https://dejavu-fonts.github.io/)
and is distributed under the permissive DejaVu Fonts License (derived from the
Bitstream Vera license with public-domain additions). It is NOT included in
this repository; you obtain it when you install ASCII-generator.

Commercial CJK fonts present in the upstream repository (simsun.ttc,
arial-unicode.ttf) were deliberately NOT installed and are NOT redistributed
here. This plugin always passes --language english.


3. QQ avatars
-------------

Avatar images are fetched at runtime from https://q1.qlogo.cn/ (a Tencent
service) and are not redistributed as part of this project. The images under
assets/ are a publicly available default QQ avatar and its locally generated
ASCII-art rendering, included solely as documentation examples.


4. Third-party platforms
------------------------

This plugin targets AstrBot (v4) with the aiocqhttp adapter and NapCat. Those
projects are separate works with their own licenses; this repository does not
include any of their code.
